    <span class="sec-num">03</span>
    <h2>Tech, AI, data and quant trackers</h2>
    <p class="lede">Use two or three, not ten. Duplicate listings across trackers are normal and not a sign of a fresh posting. The official company page always wins.</p>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Daily · broadest SWE feed</span>
        <h4><a href="https://github.com/speedyapply/2027-SWE-College-Jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SpeedyApply — 2027 SWE College Jobs</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>A broad software engineering and new-grad feed with separate U.S. and international lists.</dd>
          <dt>Coverage</dt><dd>SWE internships and new-grad roles, updated daily. Around 8,000 stars, so postings surface fast.</dd>
          <dt>Watch-out</dt><dd class="warn">Some entries are not truly Summer 2027 or carry eligibility restrictions. Open the original posting.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">New this cycle</span>
        <h4><a href="https://github.com/speedyapply/2027-AI-College-Jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SpeedyApply — 2027 AI/ML College Jobs</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>Machine learning, research and AI infrastructure roles that get buried in a general SWE list.</dd>
          <dt>Coverage</dt><dd>AI/ML internships and new-grad roles with posted hourly rates, updated daily.</dd>
          <dt>Watch-out</dt><dd class="warn">Skews heavily toward PhD and graduate-level research roles. Filter by degree level before you invest time.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Community · US + Canada</span>
        <h4><a href="https://github.com/vanshb03/Summer2027-Internships" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Summer 2027 Internships</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>A crowdsourced list scoped explicitly to the U.S., Canada and remote — one of the few that does not treat Canada as an afterthought.</dd>
          <dt>Coverage</dt><dd>Summer, fall and spring 2027 tech internships and co-ops.</dd>
          <dt>Watch-out</dt><dd class="warn">Community-maintained, so open/closed status lags. Verify before applying.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Broad · multi-function</span>
        <h4><a href="https://github.com/zapplyjobs/Internships-2027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Zapply — Internships 2027</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>Searching beyond software: business, operations, health, marketing, finance and research.</dd>
          <dt>Coverage</dt><dd>Multi-function internship listings updated in real time from employer feeds.</dd>
          <dt>Watch-out</dt><dd class="warn">Largely U.S.-oriented and the volume is overwhelming. Filter aggressively or you will spend the evening scrolling.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Workflow · autofill</span>
        <h4><a href="https://simplify.jobs/jobs/internships" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Simplify Internships</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>Search, autofill, role discovery and application tracking in a single platform.</dd>
