    <h2>Canada-specific channels</h2>
    <p class="lede">The best Canadian internship may never appear in a global GitHub list. If you are studying here, these are not optional extras — for a lot of students they are the primary channel.</p>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag alt">Canada-first · daily</span>
        <h4><a href="https://github.com/hanzili/canada_sde_intern_position" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canadian Student Internships &amp; Co-ops</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>Daily-updated Canadian student roles across tech, engineering, business, finance and sciences — including four- and eight-month co-op terms that U.S. lists ignore entirely.</dd>
          <dt>Coverage</dt><dd>Listings with term length, monthly pay in CAD and start month.</dd>
          <dt>Watch-out</dt><dd class="warn">Open/closed status is not updated daily. Check the posting yourself.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag alt">Canada · student brands</span>
        <h4><a href="https://talentegg.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TalentEgg</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>Canadian internships, co-ops, rotational programs and employer content aimed at students.</dd>
          <dt>Coverage</dt><dd>Broad Canadian employer base with student-specific framing.</dd>
          <dt>Watch-out</dt><dd class="warn">Useful but not exhaustive — plenty of employers never post there.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag alt">Canada · eligibility detail</span>
        <h4><a href="https://ca.prosple.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Prosple Canada</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>Student programs listed with eligibility, closing dates and employer profiles.</dd>
          <dt>Coverage</dt><dd>Graduate and internship programs across industries.</dd>
          <dt>Watch-out</dt><dd class="warn">Confirm the application is still open — listings can outlive the window.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag alt">Government</span>
        <h4><a href="https://www.jobbank.gc.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Job Bank</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>Government and broad-industry opportunities well outside the elite pipelines.</dd>
          <dt>Coverage</dt><dd>National listings, filterable by student or intern and by location.</dd>
          <dt>Watch-out</dt><dd class="warn">Search quality varies. Filter by student/intern and location or you will drown.</dd>
