        <span class="tag alt">Aggregator</span>
        <h4><a href="https://www.eluta.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Eluta</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>Jobs pulled directly from Canadian employer sites rather than reposted.</dd>
          <dt>Coverage</dt><dd>Wide Canadian employer index.</dd>
          <dt>Watch-out</dt><dd class="warn">Some links are duplicates or already filled.</dd>
        </dl>
