        <span class="tag alt">Your unfair advantage</span>
        <h4><a href="https://clnx.utoronto.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Your school portal — CLNx and equivalents</a></h4>
        <dl>
          <dt>Best for</dt><dd>School-exclusive postings, on-campus recruiting, resume drops and employer events.</dd>
          <dt>Coverage</dt><dd>Roles that never appear publicly, with a far smaller applicant pool.</dd>
          <dt>Watch-out</dt><dd class="warn">Deadlines routinely differ from the public posting. Check weekly, not monthly.</dd>
