    <div class="callout">
      <span class="k">The Canadian timing trap</span>
      <p>Do not map the U.S. junior-summer calendar onto Canadian co-op hiring. Many Canadian employers recruit by academic work term, which means a role you assume is gone in September may not post until November. Track both calendars separately or you will panic on the wrong schedule.</p>
