    <span class="sec-num">06</span>
    <h2>Consulting: exact status matters</h2>
    <p class="lede">There is no universal "MBB deadline," and anyone who publishes one is guessing. Each firm, school, office and degree type can run a different calendar.</p>

    <div class="tblwrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Firm</th><th>Status</th><th>What the source says</th><th>Your move</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
