            <td><strong>Second window closing</strong></td>
            <td>Bain introduced two Associate Consultant Intern windows for the 2027 cycle — 29 March and 31 August 2026 — and reviews applications in batches after each. Reporting from a former interviewer suggests a majority of interview slots fill from the first window.</td>
            <td>Submit by 31 August if eligible, then check your office-specific page.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong><a href="https://www.mckinsey.com/careers/students" target="_blank" rel="noopener">McKinsey</a></strong></td>
            <td><strong>Intern window passed</strong></td>
