  <!-- 08 -->
  <section id="underclass" class="sec">
    <span class="sec-num">08</span>
    <h2>First and second years</h2>
    <p class="lede">If you graduate in 2029, your cycle is not far away — it is starting now. Sophomore programs change names, eligibility and availability constantly, so search the official page each cycle rather than recycling an old list.</p>

    <div class="callout">
      <span class="k">The number that should get your attention</span>
      <p>Adventis expects Summer 2028 finance applications to begin appearing in August or September 2026, pick up through the fall and surge from November through January — with roughly 1,200 postings anticipated across the full cycle. It also anticipates around 160 sophomore Summer 2027 postings over the next eight months and roughly 50 early insight programs launching through early spring 2027. If you are in first or second year, that is your calendar, and it has already begun.</p>
    </div>

